{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDIzL1dXRSUyME5pZ2h0JTIwT2YlMjBDaGFtcGlvbnMlMjAlMjgyMDIzJTI5Lw","type":"movie","name":"WWE Night Of Champions","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/l11qljm6ekjmm10Fpsn11uhzGS6.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/i53IlpqAUtZJ8yRFuo3f9qPHCnm.jpg","description":"The 2023 Night of Champions is an upcoming professional wrestling pay-per-view (PPV) and live-streaming event produced by WWE. This will be the 10th Night of Champions event, the first since the 2015 event, and the first to live stream on Peacock. The event will be held for wrestlers from the promotion's Raw and SmackDown brand divisions and will be held on Saturday, May 27, 2023, at the Jeddah Super Dome in Jeddah, Saudi Arabia. It will be the ninth event that WWE will hold in Saudi Arabia under a 10-year partnership supporting Saudi Vision 2030.  Originally known as the King and Queen of the Ring as its 12th event since 2002, the WWE renamed the event on April 13, 2023, to coincide with the 1,000-day reign of Undisputed WWE Universal Champion Roman Reigns.\n\nRated NR · Released 27 May 2023 · Saudi Arabia, United States of America · Language: English · 193 min\nStudio: World Wrestling Entertainment\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2023","genres":["Action","Drama","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"6.5","runtime":"193 min","cast":["Rami Sebei","Kevin Steen","Roman Reigns","Joseph Fatu","Cody Rhodes","Brock Lesnar","Colby Lopez","Allen Jones"],"director":["Vince McMahon","Paul Levesque"],"released":"2023-05-27T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Vince McMahon","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/3m4Z7YwnTqgLlQWP7A7TgYOJrj7.jpg"},{"name":"Rami Sebei","character":"Sami Zayn","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/2Hafi5zWeNvz0j1t4Dr2umHnmG6.jpg"},{"name":"Kevin Steen","character":"Kevin Owens","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/oeGiV6JFSp7S0dlqC4kvzfPTP7Z.jp